# Blake
tags: heroes, benchmark
stimulus: Four rounds of overhead plate lunges, box jumps, wall balls and handstand push-ups.
note: The plate is held overhead for the whole lunge distance. The original posting gives men's loads only; the women's loads are the commonly used ones.
4 rounds for time
  100 ft Plate overhead lunge 45/35 lb
  30 Box jump 24/20 in
  20 Wall ball 20/14 lb
  10 Handstand push-up
